    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Do you remember what you had for breakfast last year on this day? Can you "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "recall",
            "ref": "v-recall"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the names of all your classmates in kindergarten? If not, why did you forget these things?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "First of all, the biggest reason is that, during our daily lives, we "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "focus on",
            "ref": "v-focus-on"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " understanding the world, not remembering it. For example, we go to a baseball game not to remember it, but to enjoy it. We do remember some details of the game, but they are only a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "by-product",
            "ref": "v-by-product"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of this experience."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Second, forgetting helps us to get through hard times. After something sad has happened in our lives, most of us find that time helps to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "ease",
            "ref": "v-ease"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the pain. The bad memories will slowly "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fade away",
            "ref": "v-fade-away"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Forgetting saves us from the dark times of our past."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Third, ____________________. You wouldn’t like to fill your memory with useless things, such as an old "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "password",
            "ref": "v-password"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " you no longer use. People forget unimportant information in order to better remember important details."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Don’t be sad if you forget a lot. Forgetting is just part of having a healthy memory. It can help you to experience the world more fully!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
